Third-party dependencies

  The offline test suite is standard-library only and requires no installation.
  The three packages pinned in requirements.txt are imported lazily and are
  needed only for credentialed paths that are not exercised by the test suite:

    databento           Apache-2.0
    exchange_calendars  Apache-2.0
    alpaca-py           Apache-2.0

  No third-party source code is vendored into this repository.
